## Workflow: Shipping Greatness Discovery Pipeline

**Purpose**: AI-native product discovery pipeline producing a complete product package from discovery through business case.

**Philosophy**: Code is cheap — ambiguity and timidity are expensive. Don't cut scope, expand ambition. Sequence everything, ship everything.

### Pipeline Phases

| Phase | Command | Agent | Output |
|-------|---------|-------|--------|
| 1. Discovery | `/discover` | Context Gatherer (existing) | `context-brief.md` |
| 2. Vision | `/press-release` | Vision Clarifier | Press releases + one-pager |
| 3. Knowledge Base | `/devils-advocate` + `/api-design` | Devil's Advocate + API Designer | Living FAQ + API design |
| 4. PRD | `/create-prd` + `/expand` | PRD Creator + Ambition Expander | PRD + expansion proposals |
| 5. Validation | `/red-team` | Red Team Reviewer | Red team report |
| 6. Business Case | `/swag` | SWAG Modeler | Business case model |

### Orchestration Commands

- **`/prep`** — Phases 1-3, stops before PRD
- **`/build`** — Phases 4-6, requires `/prep` artifacts
- **`/ship-it`** — Full pipeline end-to-end
- **`/status`** — Show workflow state and blockers
- **`/artifacts`** — List all generated artifacts
- **`/update-faq`** — Add entries to Living FAQ
